    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya ea neajeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanda hidu heeda Yeremiya nea gwaleabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ooleeysiina iit ng'asheegeaba neajeeni, ak girukusi fuga Yakobo ea gea abiita Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gajeeshiina, Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli: Gagasa eamoashta siida moang'waanya ng'asheegeaba neajeeni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghayi earukusi ghweanigeagwa damanda ghayi earuuni ng'eanyiida Misri, jeeda beasta gharinyeanda, nea geayeeshi, Ooleeysiiniit ng'asheegeasu, nea goosinyi gichea darukuneegwa. Ak abeeda gajahuuwa fugeasu, ak aniini ghaahuuyi ASEETEANG'WA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak hean gaydaahiit habeawooda ghayi eayeaksi ghweanigeagwa gideaba gaydaadaw ng'eanyiida guldeawa eanooga ea maleeda, gawuurji giduurji ng'eanyiida ghamneawa.” Hean geayeenyi, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA gideabali gwasunu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, “Rukwiida ng'asheesu seaniin aba jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda ea jeeda naweadinga Yerusalemu, gideaba: Oaleaydiit ng'asheegeaba neajeeni ak ghoang'waanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghayi ghaamiinyi muuchi gheanyanga ghweanigeagwa damanda earuuni gwascheeng'na ng'eanyiida Misri, ak geemajeekchi miinda gheanyanga nyaawa, ea ghoah ghamneawa, nea geayeeniisi, Asisiina mureeda ng'asheegeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean ea masinneani mureeda ghana gooleeysinean iidiga nyaawa, gaba nih ahang'waay gurooroadaanyi muy. Hean geargweaksi sean aba ng'asheega sean bea neajeeni, ghayi aadawji saawa ghoang'waay, ak ea moang'waanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta gicha gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, “Gwanda heeheeweega jeeda fuga Yuda ea gea abiita Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyam geat gabiiksa ramaseanyeeka ghweaniga nyaawa, ghayi heawa gooleeysiit ng'asheegeasu; ak ghwaat geeshta aseecheeka suuk ak ghabwat; gheeh Israeli ea gheeh Yuda nidatas neajeedeanyu ghayi easinyi ea ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, Ng'ula gaydajaksa jeeda nyaawa munyinda mayghoamu gamulsa; ak eara gooyeawusean, ea may dealeeysiit saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda eara mujiinajeega Yuda ea fuga abiita Yerusalemu gaygaweay gooyeawusa aseecheeka ghayi gwariideaysa geediga ng'andidi, ak ea mayghoamu ghaweat aba damanda sawanaduutka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aseecheekeagwa nisaang'ayiit ea gwadeena mujiinajeegeagwa, Ea fuga Yuda, ak ea saang'a ea gwadeena naweadinga Yerusalemu heeda wagiida oadeaschi bea baspaseega, was heeda wagiida sigwariideaysa geediga ng'andidi jea goohoosan Baali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi Yeremiya, adiidu gimusiischeesi fiisu, ghana ayeawusean nea gimusiischi aba badahuuka nyaawa, aba gideaba maydealeeysiit ii guurnean damanda sawanadeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga aabwariinyi neada ea gudu gwadoobiiwsa giibinda jeedeaba gheenyu aba gideaba nisin ng'asheega munyasi? Neada radita haleanjeeda ea lukghumajeega gayghoamu goohuun giidiinyeandeang'wa? Ak abeeda gajanyasa hooseaneega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi aba mwadi gaguurneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA ‘geeta nyawiish was saytuunajeanda, geeta miy bea haghweega miyaas’; ak ghamneawa aba giighweendandeeda ea siilakghta haw gaygoojoon beasta ak gaygwaduulu beasta damealgaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, ghayi ng'aaptaneeyi nibada gea munyas aba badaydaang'u, aba munyinda nisin gheeh Israeli ea gheeh Yuda, niinyareasan aba gideaba gagwardeaysa Baali geediga ng'andidi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geebada bayiiga Yeremiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA ghoahiimnaan ak ghwanung' dajeeng'u",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda fuga Anatoti, gasa gageanda eaweagaagu, nea gwayeena, “Adiidu giramoarani aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA, ea meenuuseeyi”– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega: “Ng'ula, gaydaaga ghoorjooda fiisu, gheareemanga gaygoosha aba ng'uta; nea orjooga nyaawa ea haweega nyaawa gaygahuuyda jalooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ea manda siichea gaboos. Aba gideaba gaydajaksa munyinda fuga Anatoti, gweayda lasooda nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
